"""
    Below rrc_non_3gpp_compliant_messages types are not 3GPP compliant! DL-BCCH-SCH-BR contains the same message types as DL-BCCH-SCH channel, e.g.
    SystemInformationBlockType2. To be able to differentiate between DL-BCCH-SCH channels, different naming for -BR types were applied:
    - for SIBs without extension : '-BR-r13' suffix was added, to be compliant with SIB1-BR
    - for SIBs with release extension <= 13: '-rxx' release extension was removed and '-BR-r13' suffix was added,
    - for SIBs with release extension > 13: '-rXX' release extension was removed and '-BR-rXX' suffix was added, the release number was
    copied from orinal message to '-BR-rXX' suffix
"""
